    kind: invariant  # e713
    title: "python: a receiver rooted at a subscript, call or binop emits NO call edge at all (INV-mumov's refuted emission clause does not cover non-Name roots)"  # e713
    status: violated  # e713
    priority: 2  # e713
    parent:  # e713
    tags:  # e713
    - taint  # e713
